msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:36
#: 5f25ef8b48734dd5bcb2a9d0fc6ae424
msgid "Sep 29, 2015 Copter (AC) **3.3** released. Enhancements and bug fixes. Details `here <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/Copter-3.3/ArduCopter/ReleaseNotes.txt>`__. Release announcement: `Copter-3.3 released! <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/copter-3-3-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:41
#: 7a66ca7eb0164dc6b0162750092e312e
msgid "Feb 11, 2015 Copter (AC) **3.2.1** released. Enhancements and bug fixes. Details `here <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/ArduCopter-3.2.1/ArduCopter/ReleaseNotes.txt>`__. Release announcement: `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-3-2-1-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:47
#: e61eb6b4433942c88b8adbff2d2047c2
msgid "November 07, 2014 Copter (AC) **3.2** released. Numerous enhancements and bug fixes. Details `here <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/ArduCopter-3.2/ArduCopter/ReleaseNotes.txt>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:51
#: a9fb4f9da2c64b15a9c0819e69d0da80
msgid "May 27, 2014: Copter (AC) **3.1.5** released. Enhancements and bug fixes. Details `here <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/ArduCopter-3.1.2/ArduCopter/ReleaseNotes.txt>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:55
#: e2675a212ad84f9da90f3f4fc07d6a78
msgid "January 25, 2014: Copter **3.1.1** released. Mostly enhancements and bug fixes for Pixhawk. `Details here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-3-1-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1540849>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:58
#: 83744cedac6f4ce2a0b94e904ee30586
msgid "December 14, 2013: Copter 3.1 released. Major feature additions and performance improvements. `Details here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-3-1-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:61
#: 1f315d72aa6d4f37ad7371e094491606
msgid "July 11, 2013: Copter 3.01 released. Major performance improvements. `Details here. <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-3-0-1-released>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:64
#: 9be000e202bb4328b703ddbd9800b2c7
msgid "April 5, 2013: Copter 2.9.1b released. Adds some performance enhancing parameter changes and a few small bug fixes. Details \\ `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/apm-copter-2-9-1-b-has-been-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:68
#: 83923e11bce34207b2a83fda66a7861c
msgid "Jan 17, 2013: Copter 2.9/2.9.1 released. Major performance improvements and some bug fixes. Details \\ `here <https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-9-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:72
#: e86c4855f7a44770829d9fe2aeda264e
msgid "Oct 19, 2012: Copter 2.8/2.81 released. Bug fixes and performance improvements. `Details here <https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-8-released?xg_sourceactivity>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:75
#: 5a63cc86608d49f484d7f597e8c32519
msgid "Sept 1, 2012: Copter 2.7.2 and 2.7.3 released. Bug fixes and performance improvements. `Details here. <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-7-2-released>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:78
#: acfbb65d4b364355af185241e4b50f7a
msgid "Aug 1, 2012: Copter 2.7.1 released. Minor maintenance release with a few bug fixes. Also includes preliminary support for the Digital Motion Processor (DMP) in the MPU-6000 sensor. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-7-1-released>`__ ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:84
#: 1083da70381d477aa7fbe84adcce89f6
msgid "July 24, 2012: Copter 2.7 released. Many performance improvements, including in loiter and waypoints. Adds 3-axis camera stabilization, altitude limits and geofencing. More details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-2-7-released>`__ ; details on geofencing :ref:`here <common-ac2_simple_geofence>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:91
#: eae1df66c53346b4bada58600ebcdf87
msgid "June 14, 2012: Copter 2.6 released. Includes performance enhancements, MAVLink 1.0 support, dataflash erase speedups (including proper MAVLink connectivity during erase, to improve first use experience) and support for new 3DR uBlox GPS. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-6-released>`__ ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:98
#: 7c4640ff9a7a431f9c65c15cf39d7837
msgid "May 14, 2012: Copter 2.5.5 released. Fixes a bug that affected some APM 2 boards with a newer version of the MPU-6000 sensor. Fixes bug that required some APM 2 boards to be reset after power-on. Various stability improvements. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/updated-arducopter-and-arduplane-code-apm2-users-please-upgrade>`__ ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:105
#: ef5f0e092b294efebf094f1eb9236150
msgid "March 24, 2012: Copter 2.5.3 released. Maintenance release with some bug fixes, including changing to a more appropriate throttle setting for most people in Alt Hold and re-enabling the Ch 7 auto-trim. `Details here. <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-5-released?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A816307>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:110
#: f068d53da53d45748f54e8c285bde141
msgid "March 17, 2012: Copter 2.5 released. First code optimized for the APM 2 board, which will now outperform APM 1. Significant improvements in DCM code for performance and stability. More details in the release post `here <https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-5-released>`__ ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:117
#: 0d891fc38ecf49c1b115f258218da16b
msgid "Feb 19, 2012: Copter 2.4 released. This is mostly bug fixes and performance improvements. Recommended for all users. `More details in the release post here. <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-4-released>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:120
#: b8d7821a4ade4936ac358a51c2c0a1eb
msgid "Jan 31, 2012: Copter 2.3 released. This is the feature complete release of 2.x, and is recommended for all users. More details in the release post `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-3-released>`__ ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:125
#: 05a4d5d663054ccaba96d4ba408917f5
msgid "Jan 14, 2012: Copter 2.2 released. Mostly performance enhancement, bug fixes and improved APM 2 compatibility. Autoland now much improved. More details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-2-beta>`__ ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:131
#: f064dff1d5574b3089f2d8cdb5bb5f9b
msgid "Dec 16, 2011: Copter 2.1 released. This is the first version that supports both the APM 1 and APM 2 boards. If you're building it with Arduino, you'll need the \"relaxpatch\" version of Arduino. To harmonize with APM 2, the hardware CLI switch is no longer used--you now get into the CLI by hitting \"Enter\" three times in a terminal. Other details are in the announcement post `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-56>`__ ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:139
#: 3439697c0142461bb3b3efadfb333d49
msgid "Dec 3, 2011: Copter 2.0.55 released. Most stable flying version yet. Includes new stability patch by default and a new DCM gain and clamp value that should reduce drift due to linear acceleration in missions or long flights. Switched rate gain calculation to use raw IMU rather than the DCM's omega. This crisps up the response a lot. 1280 has lost local flash logging, sorry, but it's just not supportable any longer. Some older tests have returned now the program memory is freed. Remember, to use the new logging format on the 2560, you need to erase it at least once to format it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:149
#: 6ebf2e85a1fd46df976f38ae831b2f1c
msgid "Nov 30, 2011: Copter 2.0.54 released. Bug fixes, better alt hold, CH7 switch to Simple Mode enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:152
#: 2801a7108c674a62b1796cc1f2bbdbb3
msgid "Nov 19, 2011: Copter 2.0.50 released. Many bug fixes and performance enhancements. Log files will now overwrite from the beginning when the dataflash is full (rather than stopping). Initial compatibility with MAVLink 1.0. A full list of changes is `here <https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-50>`__ ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:158
#: 01a9c27f539f4530b70b6c22c9e14203
msgid "Oct 16, 2011: Copter 2.0.49 released. Tweaked Alt Hold PIDs, Loiter PIDs based on SIM testing and feedback. Increased distance error for loiter for faster return to center. Params for camera roll gain fixed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:163
#: d7aec891fe6d4274ba4a381adfd14bde
msgid "Oct 14, 2011: Copter 2.0.48 released. The PWM output has been set to 400hz (to counter the low pass filter in most Turnigy PWMs). The DCM's Roll and Pitch gains were lowered to .03 (recommendation of Hein Hollander). MAVLink has gotten a re-work for performance and memory savings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:169
#: c0fc17e569a244868e3f93fb3d2e84ff
msgid "Oct 7, 2011: Copter 2.0.47 released. Fixed RTL overshooting bug. Better loiter PIDs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:172
#: 4b12da2e7a8e4c7d8cd6200f1ad64fd3
msgid "Oct 2, 2011: Copter 2.0.46 released. Rolls up all changes since 2.0.42, including improved sensor filtering, loiter and waypoint navigation. Simple mode has been changed and Guided mode added `(see this post for more information). <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-43>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:178
#: af1c60139b154286938071d3d7618177
msgid "Sept 11, 2011: Copter 2.0.42 released. Includes much more efficient DCM processing, now running 25% faster. Should be most stable yet. Also includes improved Circle mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:182
#: c992ddd920a64aceb54c7f96e86552ca
msgid "Sept 7, 2011: Copter 2.0.40 released. Totally new control laws, which are much more effective. Loiter should now stay within a 1m box and RTL is rock solid. New Alt Hold mixes the temperature sensor reading with the barometric pressure sensor readings for drift-free results. New flight modes, including user configurable ones. This is a release candidate for the first non-beta code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:189
#: 522981287df6447ca0112fc47b71f580
msgid "August 23, 2011: Copter 2.0.39b released. Many bug fixes and some experimental new control laws. This release is mostly for beta testing feedback to prepare for 2.0.40, which is a non-beta release candidate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:194
#: ef4e6390ef7e405f8d1d66673f0a40ac
msgid "July 30, 2011: Copter Beta 2.0.38 released. Lots of changes, big and small. Moved ground start to first arming. Added ground start flag. Moved throttle_integrator to 50hz loop. CAMERA_STABILIZER deprecated - now always on. Renamed current logging bit mask to match APM. Added MA filter to PID - D term. Adjusted PIDs based on continued testing and new PID filter. Added MASK_LOG_SET_DEFAULTS to match APM. Moved some stuff out of ground start into system start where it belonged. Added slower Yaw gains for DCM when the copter is in the air. Changed camera output to be none scaled PWM. Fixed bug where ground_temperature was unfiltered. Shortened Baro startup time. Fixed issue with Nav_WP integrator not being reset. RTL no longer yaws towards home. Circle mode for flying a 10m circle around the point where it was engaged (not tested at all! Consider it experimental)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:209
#: 6d69e58a5c88440bad33290180619c48
msgid "July 17, 2011: Copter Beta 2.0.37 released. Added rate of change limit for noisy Sonars. Code converted to static functions to save memory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:213
#: 22fe62dab9f54264b86c5ab0764d69b7
msgid "July 16, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.36 released. Added Yaw control when descending in Alt hold, lowered kP & kD for Alt hold a tad, Adjusted RTL behavior to do speed control up to 4m to home, then go into Loiter. Fixed issue with AUTO not getting proper input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:218
#: 453838bcfc7c474483c8db686e2a5139
msgid "July 12, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.35 released. Added camera reversing parameters in AP_Var, Added RTL Throttle Hold set/check, Added dynamic speed control to slow down as you reach waypoints and RTL Home, upped Yaw Dead zone slightly. Available as a hex firmware download in the Mission Planner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:224
#: 6a72593b95f54fc5ac39ecb34db87eca
msgid "July 9, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.34 preview released. Lots of new control laws and needs more testing before we give this wide release. Right now it's download only (get the file from the download section above and compile and load with Arduino). Full description of the changes in this release is `here. <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2034-preview>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:231
#: 3a18df3fc27b4409a961f6aef10b69d8
msgid "July 2, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.32 released: New Loiter PIDs, tuned down control on standard frame, shunk the mixing range for sonar from 3 meters to 2 meters, added framework for Guided mode - not tested! removed pitch and roll deadzone, decoupled S, MPLE mode from LOITER PIDs Synced MAVLink with APM, Logs report correct WP number now. Disabled Sonar spike filter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:238
#: df5876c534c74285ad7a6a4e752f9d4c
msgid "June 29, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.30 released. Minor bug fixes. Note that there is a known issue with the magnetometer, due to a change in the sensor used in recent DIY Drones magnetometer boards. The code to autodetect which one you have is still a big wonky and compass readings my be off by a factor of 2. We'll fix that in the next update."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:245
#: ed0301039b7748009e13dc6469daf653
msgid "June 27, 2011: AC Beta 2.0.28 released. Fixed serious bug (exit from !Alt_Hold left quad with controls reversed) in 2.0.26, and other tweaks. All users should upgrade immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:249
#: d4e8d35f02a84fc7894a71b63c4a0366
msgid "June 24, 2011: AC2 Beta 2.0.26 released: Minor updates. Arming motors now for only Stabilize, Simple, and Acro Modes. V Octo Support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:252
#: b7ed8d9f757b4091aa8fb83c7b04f492
msgid "June 19, 2011: AC2 Beta 2.0.25 released. This brings Copter (traditional heli) into the AC2 trunk, giving it full MAVLink capability, too. Many other tweaks and performance improvements (details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2024b>`__ ). Getting close now!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:259
#: af794b3a44cd4234907f2664d776d3ae
msgid "June 5, 2011: Much improved Mission Planner 1.0 released. Check out the `gorgeous new design! <https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/new-apm-planner-10>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:262
#: 89c1132cb3554ba585fd2463a1e4e6fd
msgid "June 3, 2011: `AC2 Beta 2.0.23 released. <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2023>`__ Minor bug fixes and tuning to improve loiter and hex airframe performance. Sonar test added to CLI test suite."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:266
#: 7907fd5c0eb9422fb3543649898e5f05
msgid "May 27, 2011: AC2 Beta 2.0.16 `released <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/705844:Topic:393643>`__ . Improvements in yaw control, minor changes in LED function, and other bug fixes. The Mission Planner has also been updated, so check the Update menu item in that to upgrade. Just a few more things left to get beta test feedback on before we'll feel confident in taking AC2 out of beta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:274
#: 1d64897df9ea473eafec867516340a9b
msgid "May 18, 2011: `AC2 beta 2.0.6 <https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/ac2-206-beta>`__ released. We're still bug-fixing at a rapid pace, so thanks for your patience. The Mission Planner has been significantly revamped, especially on the firmware upload process, which is now based on visual icons. Frame choices are now made at firmware upload time, but orientation (x vs +) can be made in the CLI. We still recommend that new users stick with the `ArduPirates code <https://code.google.com/archive/p/ardupirates/wikis/Softwares_Building.wiki>`__ , but people with well-tested hardware are invited to join the AC2 beta test. Feedback at DIY Drones, please."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:284
#: d1842e01193448b9bdd16f32a6bad7aa
msgid "May 14, 2011: AC2 beta is improving quickly, thanks to the huge increase in feedback and testing from the open beta release. The latest tested version can always be downloaded from the Mission Planner. At this point, we feel that it is stable enough for most users with well-tested hardware, although please remember it's still in beta so there may still be some bugs and you're flying at your own risk. Go through the setup process carefully and please read the manual before flying!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:293
#: fd34221936ab47898e6a585764224c1c
msgid "May 7, 2011: Copter 2 first beta released. Details `here <https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/arducopter-20-beta-first>`__ . This is an early public beta and may be unstable. Some features and portions of the manual are a work in progress and will be changed over the next few weeks. Most users are advised to continue using `ArduPirates code <https://code.google.com/archive/p/ardupirates/wikis/Softwares_Building.wiki>`__ until Copter 2 comes out of beta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:301
#: 56317a4b51cf4e28b4193140a4cacefa
msgid "May 5, 2011: Manual revised for Copter 2. Older Copter 1 manual unavailable (was on old google.code site)."
msgstr ""
